# Deprecated template retained for discoverability.
#
# The reduced-scope stack now sources every variable from the root env file.
# Copy `../../env.example` to `.env` at the repo root and keep the following
# toggles set for the demo profile:
#   STACK_PROFILE=reduced
#   SERVICE_MODE=reduced
#   COMPOSE_PROFILES=agent-api
#   REDUCED_SCOPE_ENABLED=1
# Override secrets in `.env` or a gitignored `.env.local`; this file no longer
# holds live configuration and will be removed once all docs reference the root
# template.
